  <div class="page">
    <div class="page__head">
      <p class="page__kicker">[ EST. 2023 / PACIFIC NW ]</p>
      <h1 class="page__title">Not made to fit in</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Stray Dog Clothing is an independent streetwear label for the wanderers, the outsiders, and the ones who never settle. We make trucker hats and tees built for water, sun, and the backseat next to a muddy dog.</p>
      <h2>The name</h2>
      <p>Every rescue starts as a stray — unclaimed, underestimated, tougher than it looks. That energy is the brand. We make gear for people who found their own way, and we send part of every order back to the dogs still finding theirs.</p>
      <h2>The product</h2>
      <p>Small-batch drops. Chain-stitch embroidery. Recycled crowns and organic cotton. No filler SKUs — if we wouldn't wear it on a dock at golden hour, it doesn't ship.</p>
      <h2>The drops</h2>
      <p>We release in numbered drops (FW26 // Lake Effect is live now) and restock by demand. Newsletter subscribers get first access — that's the only list.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
